- STD Mynic files for popular protocols
    Core Internet: TCP, UDP, IP, ICMP, ARP

    Network Management: SNMP, NetFlow/IPFIX, LLDP

    Secure Networking: TLP, IPsec (ESH/AH)

    Time & Synchronization: NTP, PTP (IEEE 1588)

    Wireless Networking: 802.11 Wifi frame protocols, Bluetooth L2CAP / HCI, Zigbee, LoRaWAN

    Industrial Fieldbus: CAN Bus, CANopen, DeviceNet, PROFIBUS, Modbus RTU, EtherCAT, SERCOS, POWERLINK

    Industrial Ethernet: PROFINET, EtherNet/IP, OPC UA Binary Protocol

    Robotics Framework Protocols: ROS TCPROS/UDPROS, DDS (Data Distribution Service)

    Automotive Systems: CAN (Controller Area Network), LIN (Local Interconnect Network), FlexRay, MOST, Automotive Ethernet, UDS (Unified Diagnostic Services), OBD-II protocol stack

    Aerospace, Satellites, & Rockets
        - Space Communications Standards: CCSDS (Consultative Committee for Space Data Systems), Space Packet Protocol, Telecommand, Telemetry Transfer Frames
        - Satellite Bus: SpaceWire, MIL-STD-1553, ARINC 429, ARINC 664 (AFDX)
        - Ground Communications: SLE (Space Link Extension) protocols, TDM telemetry formats
    
    Embedded/loT Systems: MQTT, CoAP, AMQP, DDS-XRCE, LwM2M

    Low-Power Radios: Thread, Z-Wave, Bluetooth LE

    Data Serialization Protocols: Protocol Buffers (Protobuf), Apache Avro, FlatBuffers, Cap’n Proto, MessagePack, CBOR, BSON

    Finance & Trading: FIX Binary (FAST/SBE), ITCH/OUCH, NASDAQ TotalView ITCH

    Storage & Filesystems: SCSI, iSCSI, NVMe, Fibre Channel, ATA/SATA, NFS (binary RPC), SMB

    Multimedia/Real-Time Streaming: RTP (Real-time Transport Protocol), RTCP, MPEG-TS, WebRTC data channels, QUIC

    Database Wire Protocols: PostgreSQL Wire Protocol, MySQL Protocol, MongoDB Wire Protocol, Redis RESP (partially text but binary safe)

    GPU / High Performance Computing: MPI (Message Passing Interface), RDMA protocols (InfiniBand & RoCE), NVLink

    Telecom / Cellular Networks: SS7, Diameter, GTP (GPRS Tunneling Protocol), SCTP

    Game Networking Protocols: RakNet, ENet, Steam Networking Protocol

    QR Code Protocols